  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In the Brazilian town of Varginha, where people say strange beings were seen and one was taken to a hospital in 1996, the Hospital Regional is said to have a plaque marking the path the creature took. The UFO documentary filmmaker James Fox says he has been there and seen it: a \"big plaque out front,\" and from the reception you learn the being was \"brought around the back.\" For Fox, the plaque shows that the town treats the event as part of its own history."
